1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,432
A few more facts.

2
00:00:01,432 --> 00:00:05,169
Methoxymethane and methoxyethane are gases.

3
00:00:05,169 --> 00:00:08,802
The others are colourless, sweet smelling liquids.

4
00:00:08,802 --> 00:00:16,575
They are very volatile and very inflammable, and the heavy vapour creeps along the bench to the nearest flame.

5
00:00:16,575 --> 00:00:22,382
And ether is lighter than water, with a density of zero point seven one three.

